# T94 URL part (row I195): an M3U holding only URL lines imports (section 17 quirk). tests/net/stream_url.cmake writes
# the playlist and substitutes @M3U@. PLAY starts queue entry 1, which must still be the URL (not resolved against
# the playlist directory), so the stream reader fetches it.
PLAYLIST_LOAD @M3U@ replace
@queue
PLAY
@render 441
@stream_stats
